1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,200
Start by selecting the farm location and tracing the parcel boundary.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:08,200
Farm attributes update the advisory: crop, harvest window, livestock, irrigation, and crew.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:13,400
Key assets are added inside the parcel so the plan protects what matters most.

4
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:22,500
The risk simulation ranks incoming fire paths by wind, fuels, weather, and asset exposure.

5
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:33,500
Protected mode shows how action lines slow the highest-risk corridors before they hit the parcel.

6
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:44,500
The report turns the simulation into a plain-English field plan for a manager or crew.

7
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:53,500
Technical details keep the backend-ready payload and ranked alternatives available for review.

8
00:00:53,500 --> 00:01:01,500
Alerts convert the same farm data into practical timing for crews, livestock, and irrigation.

9
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:06,000
AgriShield connects parcel selection, farm attributes, simulation, action planning, and reporting.
